Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:56.98,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:56.98,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}莱巴金娜 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 6-4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 汤森德 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.28,0:00:02.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Eight 1000 events this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.28,0:00:02.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,本赛季八站一千分赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:04.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Rybakina is the only player to win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,莱巴金娜是唯一一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:07.24,EN,,0,0,0,,the opening match in all eight as she comes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,八站首战全胜的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:09.56,EN,,0,0,0,,through a tough encounter closer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这一场比比分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:12.36,EN,,0,0,0,,than the score line suggests beating Taylor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:12.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,看上去更胶着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:16.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Townsend three and four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,六比三 六比四 赢下汤森德
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:19.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, credit to Townsend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:19.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,汤森德也值得肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:21.64,EN,,0,0,0,,She played a great match, played smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:21.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,她打得很好 也很聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:23.64,EN,,0,0,0,,was just maybe not good enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是可能还差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:24.52,EN,,0,0,0,,the consistency
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:24.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,差在稳定性上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:27.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to play all the those doubles in the single,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:27.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,她还要兼顾双打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:29.16,EN,,0,0,0,,but against Rybakina.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,而对手是莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:30.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Elena, I think you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 你自己清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:31.80,EN,,0,0,0,,you've played her before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你以前跟她交过手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:33.16,EN,,0,0,0,,The minute you blink your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:33.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你一眨眼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:34.68,EN,,0,0,0,,she can be right back into the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,她就能重新回到比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:35.64,EN,,0,0,0,,She's a tough opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:35.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是个难缠的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:37.80,EN,,0,0,0,,but you handled her well today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你今天处理得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:39.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she is really tough opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 她真的很难打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:40.92,EN,,0,0,0,,We played before and it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们以前交过手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:44.68,EN,,0,0,0,,was always a battle and today I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:44.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直是一场硬仗 今天我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:47.08,EN,,0,0,0,,that I was playing well first set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:47.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一盘我打得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:49.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and then in the second she stepped in it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:49.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘她压了上来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:52.68,EN,,0,0,0,,was some close points and it went
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:52.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,有几分咬得很紧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:55.08,EN,,0,0,0,,my way some net courts maybe line
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:55.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,结果偏向了我 有擦网也有压线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:57.56,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm super happy with the win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:57.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,但赢下来我非常高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.40,EN,,0,0,0,,playing great tennis made it to the finals up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你最近状态很好 上周在多伦多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:01.08,EN,,0,0,0,,in Toronto what's working right now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:01.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进了决赛 现在你的球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:02.44,EN,,0,0,0,,with your game it's so important
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是什么在起作用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:04.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to get an early start in these kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这类赛事里早点进入状态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:06.28,EN,,0,0,0,,of tournaments hardcourt season heading
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:06.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,很重要 硬地赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.28,0:01:08.04,EN,,0,0,0,,over to New York what are you happiest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.28,0:01:08.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来就是纽约了 今天这场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:10.28,EN,,0,0,0,,with about the way you played today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你最满意的是哪一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:12.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, today I'm happy with the serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:12.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天我最满意的是发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:15.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Definitely it helped me a lot and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:15.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,它确实帮了我很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:17.00,EN,,0,0,0,,last week in Toronto was very difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,上周在多伦多非常难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:18.28,EN,,0,0,0,,A lot of three set matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:18.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,打了很多三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.28,0:01:20.60,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm glad I'm managing to to survive
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.28,0:01:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我很高兴自己扛了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:22.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think we did a great preparation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:22.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们和团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:25.08,EN,,0,0,0,,with the team and hopefully I can just keep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:25.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,准备得很好 希望我能一直
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:25.96,EN,,0,0,0,,on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:28.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, Magdalena Frech in the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:28.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 下一轮是弗雷赫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:29.16,EN,,0,0,0,,You've played her a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们交过几次手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:30.68,EN,,0,0,0,,You've won all those matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你全都赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:31.72,EN,,0,0,0,,What are your thoughts on taking
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:31.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,对上弗雷赫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:33.72,EN,,0,0,0,,on Magdalena?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:33.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你怎么看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:36.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, another tough opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:36.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,又是一个难缠的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.28,0:01:37.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but I feel like for me the most important
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.28,0:01:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得最重要的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.96,0:01:39.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to focus on myself right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.96,0:01:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在先专注在自己身上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:41.72,EN,,0,0,0,,try to recover as best as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽可能把身体恢复好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:45.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and try try to come with a lot of energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:45.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后带着满满的能量上场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:46.04,EN,,0,0,0,,good serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:46.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,把发球打好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.04,0:01:47.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, hopefully it's going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.04,0:01:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望那会是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:49.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to be a nice match and thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场好球 也谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.08,0:01:51.16,EN,,0,0,0,,so much for coming and supporting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.08,0:01:51.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天到场支持的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:52.20,EN,,0,0,0,,All right, we love watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 我们都爱看你打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:54.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Best of luck to you, Elena Rybakina,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:54.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你好运 埃琳娜·莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:56.98,EN,,0,0,0,,everybody through to the third round.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:56.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,各位 她晋级第三轮
